# Cargo build output. Plugin is a path dependency — the app's Cargo.lock
# governs versions, so this crate carries no lock of its own.
/target
Cargo.lock

# Generated by the Tauri mobile plugin build (tauri_plugin::Builder / CLI):
#  - **/.tauri                  the copied tauri-api Swift/Kotlin package + Gradle build output
#  - permissions/autogenerated  per-command permission tomls + reference.md
# All regenerated on every build; never commit.
**/.tauri
/permissions/autogenerated
# SwiftPM lockfile — pins the regenerated .tauri/tauri-api package, so it is a
# build artifact too.
**/Package.resolved
